l,["zh-Hant"],[["——\n\n樂山娘拉麵中山店整體給人的感覺相當接地氣，是一間很有「台式靈魂」的拉麵店。湯頭走的是濃郁路線，鹹香厚實，不是日式那種清爽型，反而更貼近台灣人熟悉的口味，喝起來很有滿足感，而且可以加湯這點真的大加分，對於湯控來說非常友善，也讓整碗拉麵從頭到尾都維持在好喝的狀態。\n\n店面裝潢走復古風格，帶點老派懷舊的味道，不浮誇但很有特色，坐在裡面吃麵會有一種時光慢下來的感覺，氣氛輕鬆自在。至於餃子表現就比較普通，口味中規中矩，沒有特別驚艷，如果是第一次來，其實可以把胃容量留給拉麵本身。\n\n另外一個讓人覺得貼心的小細節是支援行動支付，結帳快速又方便，對現在習慣無現金的人來說相當加分。整體來說，樂山娘拉麵不是走精緻系，而是靠實在的湯頭取勝，單純為了拉麵本身，我會願意再回訪。🍜",null,[0,2]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3591866835394466115/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDV2xOR1RYaGtTRlp6VmtWRmVsSnFTbXRhYlU1b1dqSkdSbGRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3591866835394466115/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDV2xOR1RYaGtTRlp6VmtWRmVsSnFTbXRhYlU1b1dqSkdSbGRGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3591866835394466115/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDV2xOR1RYaGtTRlp6VmtWRmVsSnFTbXRhYlU1b1dqSkdSbGRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3591866835394466115/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDV2xOR1RYaGtTRlp6VmtWRmVsSnFTbXRhYlU1b1dqSkdSbGRGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3591866835394466115/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDV2xOR1RYaGtTRlp6VmtWRmVsSnFTbXRhYlU1b1dqSkdSbGRGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3591866835394466115/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDV2xOR1RYaGtTRlp6VmtWRmVsSnFTbXRhYlU1b1dqSkdSbGRGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3822,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CWlNGTXhkSFZzVkVFelJqSmtabU5oWjJGRldFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1edd4325fd0e5742!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnBZSFMxdHVsVEEzRjJkZmNhZ2FFWEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CWlNGTXhkSFZzVkVFelJqSmtabU5oWjJGRldFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25C